WEBVTT

00:18:58.669 --> 00:19:01.805
CA:... but if you were to actually
hear their internal dialogue,

00:19:01.829 --> 00:19:06.174
they definitely often get
that sort of feeling of social stress,

00:19:06.198 --> 00:19:09.067
of, "I need to breathe,
I need some me time,

00:19:09.091 --> 00:19:10.431
I need to get away.

00:19:10.455 --> 00:19:13.102
Take me back to my hotel room,
take me out of here."

00:19:13.126 --> 00:19:14.300
Is that right?

00:19:14.324 --> 00:19:18.291
SC: I cannot even tell you how many people
are described by what you just said.

00:19:18.315 --> 00:19:20.336
And I first learned this,

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:22.585
well, I guess I saw it
during my book research,

00:19:22.609 --> 00:19:26.179
but I really felt it
when I gave the TED Talk.

00:19:26.203 --> 00:19:29.562
You might remember, I was one
of the first speakers that year,

00:19:29.586 --> 00:19:30.988
and I came off the stage